{"pageProps":{"post":{"title":"Control Flow: Conditionals","excerpt":"Learn how to use conditional statements in Python to control program flow.","createdAt":"2024-01-17","author":{"name":"GoProgrammingHub","permalink":"/authors/manoj-pawar","profilePictureUrl":"/images/manoj-pawar.jpg","slug":"manoj-pawar"},"body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" name=\"viewport\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Control Flow: Conditionals</h1>\n    <h2>if Statement</h2>\n    <div class=\"remark-highlight\">\n      <pre class=\"language-python\"><code class=\"language-python\">x<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">if</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span>x<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"x<span class=\"token space\"> </span>is<span class=\"token space\"> </span>greater<span class=\"token space\"> </span>than<span class=\"token space\"> </span>5\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <h2>if-else Statement</h2>\n    <div class=\"remark-highlight\">\n      <pre class=\"language-python\"><code class=\"language-python\">age<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">17</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">if</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span>age<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">>=</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">18</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"You<span class=\"token space\"> </span>are<span class=\"token space\"> </span>an<span class=\"token space\"> </span>adult\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"You<span class=\"token space\"> </span>are<span class=\"token space\"> </span>a<span class=\"token space\"> </span>minor\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <h2>if-elif-else Statement</h2>\n    <div class=\"remark-highlight\">\n      <pre class=\"language-python\"><code class=\"language-python\">score<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">85</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">if</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span>score<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">>=</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">90</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Grade:<span class=\"token space\"> </span>A\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span>score<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">>=</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">80</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Grade:<span class=\"token space\"> </span>B\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span>score<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">>=</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">70</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Grade:<span class=\"token space\"> </span>C\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Grade:<span class=\"token space\"> </span>D\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <h2>Nested if Statements</h2>\n    <div class=\"remark-highlight\">\n      <pre class=\"language-python\"><code class=\"language-python\">num<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">15</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">if</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span>num<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">if</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span>num<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">%</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Positive<span class=\"token space\"> </span>even<span class=\"token space\"> </span>number\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Positive<span class=\"token space\"> </span>odd<span class=\"token space\"> </span>number\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Number<span class=\"token space\"> </span>is<span class=\"token space\"> </span>not<span class=\"token space\"> </span>positive\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <h2>Ternary Operator</h2>\n    <div class=\"remark-highlight\">\n      <pre class=\"language-python\"><code class=\"language-python\">age<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">20</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span>status<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token string\">\"Adult\"</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">if</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span>age<span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">>=</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">18</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token space\"> </span><span class=\"token string\">\"Minor\"</span><span class=\"token lf\"></span>\n<span class=\"token lf\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>status<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code></pre>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>\n","slug":"07_conditionals"},"posts":[{"title":"Introduction to Python","excerpt":"Learn the basics of Python programming language and its applications.","createdAt":"2024-01-17","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/programming/python/01_introduction","index":0,"slug":"01_introduction"},{"title":"Setting Up Python Environment","excerpt":"Step-by-step guide to install Python and set up your development environment.","createdAt":"2024-01-17","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/programming/python/02_setup","index":1,"slug":"02_setup"},{"title":"Python Syntax Basics","excerpt":"Learn the fundamental syntax rules of Python programming language.","createdAt":"2024-01-17","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/programming/python/03_syntax_basics","index":2,"slug":"03_syntax_basics"},{"title":"Variables and Data Types","excerpt":"Learn about Python variables and the different data types available.","createdAt":"2024-01-17","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/programming/python/04_variables_data_types","index":3,"slug":"04_variables_data_types"},{"title":"Operators","excerpt":"Learn about different types of operators in Python and how to use them.","createdAt":"2024-01-17","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/programming/python/05_operators","index":4,"slug":"05_operators"},{"title":"Input and Output","excerpt":"Learn how to handle input and output operations in Python.","createdAt":"2024-01-17","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/programming/python/06_input_output","index":5,"slug":"06_input_output"},{"title":"Control Flow: Conditionals","excerpt":"Learn how to use conditional statements in Python to control program flow.","createdAt":"2024-01-17","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/programming/python/07_conditionals","index":6,"slug":"07_conditionals"},{"title":"Control Flow: Loops","excerpt":"Learn how to use loops in Python to repeat code execution.","createdAt":"2024-01-17","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/programming/python/08_loops","index":7,"slug":"08_loops"},{"title":"Functions","excerpt":"Learn how to define and use functions in Python to organize and reuse code.","createdAt":"2024-01-17","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/programming/python/09_functions","index":8,"slug":"09_functions"},{"title":"Lists and Tuples","excerpt":"Learn how to work with Python lists and tuples, two fundamental sequence types.","createdAt":"2024-01-17","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/programming/python/10_lists_tuples","index":9,"slug":"10_lists_tuples"},{"title":"Dictionaries and Sets","excerpt":"Learn how to work with Python dictionaries and sets, two powerful data structures.","createdAt":"2024-01-17","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/programming/python/11_dictionaries_sets","index":10,"slug":"11_dictionaries_sets"},{"title":"String Manipulation","excerpt":"Learn how to work with strings in Python, including formatting, methods, and operations.","createdAt":"2024-01-17","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/programming/python/12_strings","index":11,"slug":"12_strings"},{"title":"How to execute SQL queries (Select, Update, Insert, Delete) effectively using Python?","excerpt":"The database is an integral part of most software applications. We always try to find out what is the best way to connect to the database. Often use readily available frameworks. The one thing I have experienced often frameworks or libraries provide a lot of abstractions to make it easy for end developers to use the framework or library.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/programming/python/How-to-execute-sql-queries-database-using-python-effectively","index":12,"slug":"How-to-execute-sql-queries-database-using-python-effectively"}],"index":null},"__N_SSG":true}